#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R01
#. Intent: Confirm deployment and establish the immediate objective.
#: missions/m01.md:R01
msgid "dialogue.m01.com01.l001"
msgstr "ROOK、展開が確認されました。アッシュフォール住宅タワー、セクター 7。"

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R01
#. Intent: State the required mission sequence concisely.
#: missions/m01.md:R01
msgid "dialogue.m01.com01.l002"
msgstr "セクターの電力を回復し、閉じ込められたセキュリティチームを回収し、中継リンクに到達します。"

#. Speaker: VECTOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R02
#. Intent: Establish that VECTOR is active elsewhere in Ashfall District.
#: missions/m01.md:R02
msgid "dialogue.m01.com02.l001"
msgstr "ルーク、ベクター。私は2ブロック東にいます。同じ火災、同じ通信不能。"

#. Speaker: VECTOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R02
#. Intent: Direct attention toward the drones without stopping the tutorial.
#: missions/m01.md:R02
msgid "dialogue.m01.com02.l002"
msgstr "何かがドローンを占有フロアに向けて誘導しています。ここから辿ってみます。"

#. Speaker: SECURITY_OFFICER
#. Delivery: In person
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Introduce the first contradiction in ROOK’s remembered history.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com03.l001"
msgstr "船長？"

#. Speaker: SECURITY_OFFICER
#. Delivery: In person
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Make the recognition specific without explaining it.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com03.l002"
msgstr "私はケストレルブリッジであなたが死ぬのを見ました。 8年前。"

#. Speaker: ROOK
#. Delivery: In person
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Keep ROOK controlled and focused on the rescue.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com03.l003"
msgstr "間違った兵士がいます。移動できますか？"

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Offer a plausible explanation while redirecting the mission.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com04.l001"
msgstr "神経学的曝露により、誤った認識やアイデンティティの投影が生じる可能性があります。"

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Close the interruption and return the player to the objective.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com04.l002"
msgstr "生存者を確保し、輸送を続けます。"

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Facility channel
#. Intent: M06 arrival; OPERATOR's final direct address before becoming unreachable.
#: missions/m06.md
msgid "dialogue.m06.com01.l001"
msgstr "dialogue.m06.com01.l001"

